sequenceDiagram
    participant Orch as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant BuiltIn as Built-in Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Judge as LLM Judge Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference Server<br/>VLLM_BASE_URL
    participant MinIO as MinIO Storage<br/>9000/TCP
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over Orch,vLLM: Flow 1: Built-in Detection (Local regex/file-type)
    Orch->>BuiltIn: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>ContentsAnalysisRequest
    BuiltIn->>BuiltIn: Apply regex patterns<br/>& file-type validation
    BuiltIn-->>Orch: ContentsAnalysisResponse<br/>detection results

    Note over Orch,vLLM: Flow 2: HuggingFace Detection (Local model inference)
    Orch->>HF: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>ContentsAnalysisRequest
    Note right of HF: PyTorch inference:<br/>sequence classification,<br/>token classification,<br/>or causal LM
    HF->>MinIO: Load model artifacts<br/>(aws-connection secret)
    MinIO-->>HF: Model weights
    HF->>HF: Run local inference<br/>(no external HTTP calls)
    HF-->>Orch: ContentsAnalysisResponse<br/>classification results

    Note over Orch,vLLM: Flow 3: LLM Judge Detection (Remote vLLM inference)
    Orch->>Judge: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>ContentsAnalysisRequest
    Judge->>vLLM: HTTP evaluation request<br/>via vllm_judge.Judge client
    Note right of vLLM: Evaluate against metrics:<br/>safety, toxicity,<br/>accuracy, helpfulness
    vLLM-->>Judge: Evaluation response
    Judge-->>Orch: ContentsAnalysisResponse<br/>judge evaluation results

    Note over Orch,Prom: Flow 4: Metrics Collection
    Prom->>BuiltIn: GET /metrics<br/>(multi-process collector)
    BuiltIn-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics<br/>(detections, requests, errors)
    Prom->>HF: GET /metrics<br/>(fastapi-instrumentator)
    HF-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
    Prom->>Judge: GET /metrics<br/>(fastapi-instrumentator)
    Judge-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
